0..73 Comment "// What a forward flow cannot decide, after directed univalence (Gratzer,"
74..151 Comment "// Weinberger and Buchholtz, _Directed univalence in simplicial homotopy type"
152..228 Comment "// theory_, arXiv:2407.09146, Definition 1.2): a translator\'s image may only"
229..305 Comment "// move the source\'s leaves, so one that writes a literal where a leaf stood"
306..373 Comment "// is refused, and so is one whose image rides a list\'s tail again."
